This original implementation provides a bounded named-experiment and restoration
CLI for the available-key sysctl workflow in docs/port/tools-functionality.md.
It contains no CachyOS sysctl-manager code, Qt assets or preset configuration.
Python and Linux proc/sys are supplied by the chosen base. Neither the package
architecture declaration nor temporary-tree controls establish ARM/M2 behavior.
